{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Quiet Night at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Couch Talk", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> when you want things to be different or you hope(d) for a different past or present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> I <span class=\"strong\">could</span> win some money like you did and take a break.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Think of all the places you <span class=\"strong\">could</span> go <span class=\"strong\">if</span> you <span class=\"strong\">had</span> the money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What countries <span class=\"strong\">would</span> you head to <span class=\"strong\">if</span> you <span class=\"strong\">could</span>?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Wish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that-clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">really wish</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">that I could work with a chef in Paris.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can omit <span class=\"strong\">that</span> in the that-clause. <br> For example: <span class=\"italic\">I really wish (that) I could work with a chef.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">second conditional</span> to talk about imaginary situations in the present or future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If-clause (condition)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If + subject + Simple Past,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + modal  (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">could</span>, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span>, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">should</span>, <span class=\\\"italic\\\">might</span>)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you did, </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">it would be wonderful!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Exchanging Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you exchange opinions, you give your ideas on a topic. Usually the person you are talking to responds to your opinion.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving an Opinion</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Responding to an Opinion</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Don't you think ... ?<br/>I think that ... <br/>As I see it ... <br/>I think ... <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, it is, isn't it? <br/> That's what I was going to say! <br/>I agree. <br/>That's what I was thinking!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Don't you think</span> having quality downtime with friends is important? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Yes, it is, isn't it?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: It's relaxing to let our hair down and just be ourselves <span class=\"strong\">don't you think</span>? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: That's true.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I think that</span> winning the lottery gave you an amazing opportunity. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">That's what I was going to say!</span>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be on the go", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be very active; to be extremely busy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm continually on the go at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to let your hair down", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to relax; to lose your inhibitions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's relaxing to go out and let your hair down a bit.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be yourself", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to act naturally", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I'm here, I can just be myself.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be wound up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be stressed; to be tense", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Work is stressful, so I feel wound up when I'm there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tantalizing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "exciting to the senses", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That 