ype": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le13ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, it is isn't it? Being continually on the go is hard. It's relaxing to let our hair down and just be ourselves, don't you think?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's true. At work, I'm always wound up. It's exhausting! I wish I could win some money like you did and take a break. I would be thrilled!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le13ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It would be wonderful if you did. Think of all the places you could go if you had the money. Imagine the tantalizing dishes you could learn to make!  What countries would you head to if you could?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I really wish I could work with a chef in Paris. I'd also want to take a culinary tour of India and try authentic regional food. I think it would be inspiring!", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn7le13ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's what I was thinking!  It would be so exciting! Unfortunately, as I see it, without a lot of money it's harder to do.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I agree. I think your lottery winnings gave you an amazing opportunity.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's what I was going to say!", "id": 3, "time": "41000", "image": "engenn7le13ob01re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le13ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le13ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}